              "title": "ACCESS-CONTROL.LOGICAL — Logical access provisioning and least privilege",
              "description": "Logical access to systems and tenant data is granted through an authorized request, provisioned on the principle of least privilege, and recertified periodically; access rights are matched to a documented role rather than granted ad hoc.",
